# catalog/lane-run-inputs.d/fly-pool.ro — what one `bin/fly-pool-project.sh $p`
# run (bin/fly-pool.sh $p with POOL_ON_MACHINE=1) reads and never writes back
# (BH-7505). The snapshot is fly-pool.rw plus these lines. The file:line after
# each entry is where bin/fly-pool.sh reads it.
#
# NOT IN THE SNAPSHOT. Repo-tracked files the machine pulls with main (bin/*,
# catalog/*): the image bakes them and bin/lib/lane-run-code.sh swaps them in.
# Secrets: env/* (the Fly token, the GitHub App key and the agent credentials
# are Fly secrets of the lane-run app, fly/lane-run-entrypoint.sh).
# state/auth-accounts.local.json: the Claude account routing the hub copies into
# a spawn's env bundle (bin/fly-pool.sh:4831). It is not carried; a machine
# spawns on the global account until the routing is a row.
#
# The project registry (bin/fly-pool.sh:531, :2416, :2523)
fleet.conf
# The pause, hold, halt and dispatch flags and the pool enable switch
# (bin/fly-pool.sh:36, :60, :100, :167, :184, :4073, :4101)
flags/*
# The project's Fly app and image pointer (bin/fly-pool.sh:78, :4118)
state/fly/$p.json
state/fly/$p.image
# Reviewed lines in git that a machine's image does not carry
# (bin/pool-cap.sh:82, bin/lib/pool-account.sh:141)
fly/pool-caps.conf
fly/account-capacity.conf
# The deploy snapshot lane's record (bin/fly-pool.sh:3789, :4510)
state/vercel-deploys/$p.json
# The overlap guard's After: markers (bin/fly-pool.sh:1857, bin/plan-after.sh:81)
state/overlap-after/$p/*
# NOT carried: plans/$p-<KEY>/* (push_preplan, bin/fly-pool.sh:2385). One dir
# per ticket since the project began, so a snapshot of them can pass
# lane_snapshot.max_bytes. With no plan.md on the machine push_preplan reads the
# pre-plan from the jobs worker (preplan_fetch), the path it takes on any box
# that never ran the plan.
# BH-7431 (BH-6896 S4): the pre-plan record of the test-home step, read through
# th_record_path (bin/fly-pool.sh:2451, bin/lib/test-home-lib.sh:52)
state/preplan-files/$p-*
# The dispatch-now markers bin/cmd-dispatch-issue.sh writes (bin/fly-pool.sh:179)
state/dispatch-now/$p/*
